{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination\/enriched(by:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enriched"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context."}]}],"name":"enricher"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"type":"text","text":" runs, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"first"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sees what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"type":"text","text":" set and has the last word on a key both set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as "},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" adds "},{"code":"SessionStarted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"code":"SessionEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{